/*!
\page page_stzdctriggerdetector StZdcTriggerDetector

\brief ZDC trigger detector data: ADC/TDC for forward neutron calorimeters, SMD strips, vertex z.

\section stzdctriggerdetector_overview Overview
\c StZdcTriggerDetector stores data from the Zero Degree Calorimeter (ZDC), which
detects spectator neutrons at ±18 m.  Raw ADC and TDC values, east/west ADC sums, an
online z-vertex estimate from east–west timing, and Shower Maximum Detector (SMD) strip
energies for transverse position are all stored.  The ZDC is central to centrality
determination, luminosity monitoring, and spin asymmetry measurements.

\section stzdctriggerdetector_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StZdcTriggerDetector
\endcode

\section stzdctriggerdetector_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Float_t[16] | mAdc | Raw ADC values (east 0–7, west 8–15) |
| Float_t[16] | mTdc | Raw TDC values |
| Float_t[2] | mSumAdc | East[0] and west[1] ADC sums |
| Float_t[2][2][8] | ZdcSmd | SMD energies [east/west][vert/horiz][strip] |

\section stzdctriggerdetector_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `float adc(int i) const` | Raw ADC at channel i |
| `float tdc(int i) const` | Raw TDC at channel i |
| `float adcSum(StBeamDirection dir) const` | ADC sum east or west |
| `float adcSum() const` | Combined ADC sum |
| `float vertexZ() const` | Online vertex z (cm) |
| `float zdcSmd(StBeamDirection, int verthori, int strip) const` | SMD strip energy |
| `int numberOfZdcWords() const` | Raw data word count |

\section stzdctriggerdetector_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StZdcTriggerDetector& zdc = event->triggerDetectorCollection()->zdc();
cout << "ZDC east sum = " << zdc.adcSum(east) << endl;
cout << "ZDC vertex z = " << zdc.vertexZ() << " cm" << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_sttriggerdetectorcollection
\see \ref page_stbbctriggerdetector
*/
